OL,3,ALost oyster beds rediscovered thanks to
OL,4,AGaelic and Scots language
OL,5,
OL,6,FLong lost oyster beds on the West Coast
OL,7,Fof Scotland have been rediscovered
OL,8,Fthanks to Gaelic and Scots language.
OL,10,FScientists searched for the inclusion
OL,11,Fof the Gaelic words for oyster or
OL,12,Foysters ` eisir, eisirein and eisirean
OL,13,F` and oyster habitats like sandy banks
OL,14,For tidal causeways in place names
OL,15,Faround Scotland's coast.
OL,17,FThey then found an oyster bed that had
OL,18,Fnot been previously documented, as well
OL,19,Fas confirming oysters could have been
OL,20,Fpresent at other sites on Mull and
OL,21,FIslay.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,311,300,200,140,0,100
