OL,3,ALost oyster beds rediscovered thanks to
OL,4,AGaelic and Scots language
OL,5,
OL,6,FNative oysters were once abundant in
OL,7,Fcoastal European waters, including
OL,8,FScotland, but now only remnant
OL,9,Fpopulations are known to remain due to
OL,10,Foverharvesting and disease.
